@startuml AD-1_charge_vehicle
!include _style.iuml
title AD-1 (WF-01) Find a Station and Charge End to End\n<size:11>Scope: PowerMe «software system» · Trigger: driver wants to charge · Owner: Lý Hoàng Sơn · v2.0 (ADR-0015: no reservation path)</size>

|Driver\n«person»|
start
:Find station or get suggestion\n(UC-CHG-01, UC-CHG-07 · AD-5); <<procedure>>
:Scan connector QR code\nand choose charging limit;
|PowerMe Platform\n«software system»|
:Check connector status\nand available Charging Credit;
if ( ) then ([connector Faulted, Unavailable,\nin use or pillar offline])
  :Show reason and\nalternative stations; <<output>>
  stop
else ([connector Available or Preparing])
endif
if ( ) then ([available credit < start minimum\nor CreditAccount in_shortfall])
  :Refuse start and offer top-up\n(UC-PAY-01 · AD-3); <<output>>
  stop
else ([available credit >= start minimum])
endif
:Cap charging limit at what\nthe credit can pay for;
:ChargingSession\n[pending]; <<task>>
:Send start command; <<output>>
|#EEEEEE|Charging Pillar\n«external system»|
if ( ) then ([start rejected or no StartTransaction\nbefore start timeout])
  |PowerMe Platform\n«software system»|
  :ChargingSession\n[failed]; <<task>>
  :Tell driver the start failed\n(no charge); <<output>>
  stop
else ([start accepted])
  |#EEEEEE|Charging Pillar\n«external system»|
  :Start energy delivery and\nreport readings periodically;
endif
|PowerMe Platform\n«software system»|
:ChargingSession\n[active]; <<task>>
repeat
  :Receive meter readings; <<input>>
  :Update energy, running cost\nand credit left;
  :Push progress to driver app\n(UC-CHG-04, ≤ 5 s); <<output>>
repeat while ([no stop condition])
-> [stop condition met];
if ( ) then ([limit reached, credit at\ncutoff reserve, or driver tapped Stop])
  :ChargingSession\n[stopping]; <<task>>
  :Send stop command; <<output>>
  |#EEEEEE|Charging Pillar\n«external system»|
  :Stop energy delivery;
else ([battery full or stopped at pillar])
  |#EEEEEE|Charging Pillar\n«external system»|
  :Stop energy delivery by itself;
endif
|#EEEEEE|Charging Pillar\n«external system»|
:Report session end;
|PowerMe Platform\n«software system»|
:ChargingSession\n[closed]; <<task>>
:Cross-check energy, price\nper tariff band;
:Debit Charging Credit;
:CreditTransaction\n[session_debit]; <<task>>
:Award loyalty points;
:LoyaltyTransaction\n[earned]; <<task>>
:ChargingSession\n[reconciled]; <<task>>
:Send charging statement; <<output>>
|Driver\n«person»|
:View charging statement\n(UC-PAY-02);
stop

floating note left
  Driver may tap Stop at any time (UC-CHG-03).
  Pause by EV or pillar keeps the same session:
  [active] ⇄ [paused] (STM-1 #5–6).
  Pillar offline mid-session → AD-2 (WF-03).
  Card / free-vend start at the pillar → AD-6.
end note
!include _legend.iuml
@enduml